                        ],
                        "form": "more generative"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f2166f38-c615-429f-8280-0ad71a204d37",
                        "entry_id": "eb00f0c2-43f7-317c-8ede-a6aaac90139c",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most generative"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "42f47ff1-e4d4-3a02-b02d-830930724257",
                        "entry_id": "eb00f0c2-43f7-317c-8ede-a6aaac90139c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having the power of generating, propagating, originating, or producing."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "05b4cb42-308b-47a1-be39-a64ad3475a33",
                                "sense_id": "42f47ff1-e4d4-3a02-b02d-830930724257",
                                "text": "That generative particle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5bd9fcdd-b65c-4d79-a528-396626678353",
                                "sense_id": "42f47ff1-e4d4-3a02-b02d-830930724257",
                                "text": "Of course, structures like those associated with (36) and (37) constitute only a tiny subset of the infinite set of well-formed sentence structures found in English. We can increase the Generative Capacity of our grammar ( = the set of structures which it generates) either by expanding the Lexicon on the one hand, or by expanding the Categorial Rules (i.e. Phrase Structure Rules) on the other."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a7d9353-ff01-4dae-8581-d899c20609d1",
                                "sense_id": "42f47ff1-e4d4-3a02-b02d-830930724257",
                                "text": "The document states that despite its ongoing advancements, generative AI is liable to the United States’s current copyright principles, which take a strict stance on what material—human- or machine-made—qualifies for protection."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "96f30497-91cc-3871-93a3-b8e98b71f6cb",
                        "entry_id": "eb00f0c2-43f7-317c-8ede-a6aaac90139c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Reproductive."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "euphemistic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7ff352f-fcd5-45d3-b53b-770fd122da48",
                                "sense_id": "96f30497-91cc-3871-93a3-b8e98b71f6cb",
                                "text": "Hence the ubiquity of Priapus himself as a sculptural representative of the generative principle, populated the Roman gardens, assertive in ithyphallic pose."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb565b64-8369-4538-a7a0-6925f8d1cf0e",
                                "sense_id": "96f30497-91cc-3871-93a3-b8e98b71f6cb",
                                "text": "This ceremony seals the covenant in the flesh of the male generative organ."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bc002bbc-3b0b-406f-806a-5732497fe9bd",
                        "source_entry_id": "eb00f0c2-43f7-317c-8ede-a6aaac90139c",
                        "source_sense_description": "having the power of generating",
                        "target_lang_word": "génératif",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "génératif",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a47049d-b26d-3de8-b8c4-eba14d1c464f",
                                        "entry_id": "f2796d59-5b59-3a76-8da8-b060fc2ae0eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie un mode de reproduction des plantes par la voie sexuelle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3153db44-c9aa-4007-9576-40e68dcac439",
                                                "sense_id": "5a47049d-b26d-3de8-b8c4-eba14d1c464f",
                                                "text": "Cette situation de la canne à sucre, plante de multiplication végétative, est à opposer au cas des graminées à reproduction générative, telles les céréales, chez lesquelles les facteurs de résistance aux maladies, introduits dans les cultivars au XXᵉ siècle se sont révélés instables dans le temps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "80cc731c-0374-36f1-8f67-d160e09e1c0d",
                                        "entry_id": "f2796d59-5b59-3a76-8da8-b060fc2ae0eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie une approche de la grammaire fondée sur la manière dont les phrases sont générées."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Intelligence artificielle"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdfc1021-013d-4d53-a354-777fada6dafa",
                                                "sense_id": "80cc731c-0374-36f1-8f67-d160e09e1c0d",
                                                "text": "Mon père a inventé un dispositif qui calcule l'influence de la lune sur les marées terrestres et ma mère a traduit pour Chomsky des traités de grammaire générative."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3854101d-2dd9-3139-937b-c35492d3213b",
                                        "entry_id": "f2796d59-5b59-3a76-8da8-b060fc2ae0eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie un art produit de manière itérative en faisant intervenir le hasard."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "343929db-2435-36e2-ae5f-15908776a83d",
                                        "entry_id": "f2796d59-5b59-3a76-8da8-b060fc2ae0eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui permet de générer automatiquement (des images, par exemple)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7926c744-1f02-41e0-81ba-77b95c14d860",
                                                "sense_id": "343929db-2435-36e2-ae5f-15908776a83d",
                                                "text": "« Il faut que les gens puissent authentifier de manière fiable, raisonnable et éthique le vrai travail des journalistes », analyse Olivier Zetlers, cofondateur de Yokai.ai, une start-up française experte en IA générative."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ddbb77bb-950d-4ac6-9a6d-71e05be8270e",
                        "source_entry_id": "eb00f0c2-43f7-317c-8ede-a6aaac90139c",
                        "source_sense_description": "having the power of generating",
                        "target_lang_word": "generativ",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "generativ",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b3794b6-f55f-3449-96a1-d14ec24401c0",
                                        "entry_id": "c2dc0744-132c-392b-8d10-7289d4a39a04",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "auf das Fortpflanzungsverhalten bezogen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9349c4d-64ef-4ed6-af0c-f4da14b84370",
                                                "sense_id": "0b3794b6-f55f-3449-96a1-d14ec24401c0",
                                                "text": "„Erste Ergebnisse deuten an, daß es eine kleine Gruppe politischer Protagonisten gab, deren politisches wie generatives Verhalten den propagierten Gefährtenidealen des Vormärz nahekommt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3013e300-b494-3805-b849-06322d0cbd46",
                                        "entry_id": "c2dc0744-132c-392b-8d10-7289d4a39a04",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "auf die Erzeugung von Sätzen bezogen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfc0758c-0fd1-48fb-b3b9-bd7fc5cffb85",
                                                "sense_id": "3013e300-b494-3805-b849-06322d0cbd46",
                                                "text": "In der Linguistik bedeutete der Übergang von der strukturalistischen zur generativen Grammatik einen Wendepunkt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f58f430-aa35-4930-9411-bfdb91b0bd52",
                                                "sense_id": "3013e300-b494-3805-b849-06322d0cbd46",
                                                "text": "„Auch über die generative Grammatik führte ein Weg zur Universalien-Grammatik.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1b40a62-429c-4431-9f6d-1eb57a102f2b",
                                                "sense_id": "3013e300-b494-3805-b849-06322d0cbd46",
                                                "text": "„Die Bezeichnung generativ deutet darauf hin, daß die entsprechende Grammatik Erzeugungsregeln hat.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
